    <string name="setup_pushup">Phone on the floor, screen up, right under your face.</string>
    <string name="setup_side">Stand the phone up about 2 m away, with your side facing it. Your whole body must be on screen.</string>
    <string name="setup_side_floor">Prop the phone low (floor or chair) about 2 m away, with your side facing it. Your whole body must be on screen.</string>
    <string name="setup_front">Stand the phone up 2 to 3 m away, facing you. Your whole body must be on screen.</string>
    <string name="setup_pullup">Put the phone facing the bar, far enough to show you whole, straight arms included.</string>
    <string name="setup_walk">Uses your phone\'s step sensor. You can keep it in your pocket.</string>
    <string name="squat_1">Feet shoulder-width apart, toes slightly out.</string>
    <string name="squat_2">Sit back as if onto a chair until your thighs are parallel to the floor, chest up.</string>
    <string name="squat_3">Stand up pushing the floor through your heels.</string>
    <string name="situp_1">Lie on your back with knees bent and feet on the floor.</string>
    <string name="situp_2">Lift your torso until you are almost sitting, without pulling your neck.</string>
    <string name="situp_3">Lower slowly until your back touches the floor.</string>
    <string name="jack_1">Start standing, feet together and arms by your sides.</string>
    <string name="jack_2">Jump your feet apart and bring your hands above your head.</string>
    <string name="jack_3">Jump back to the start. That is 1 jumping jack.</string>
    <string name="plank_1">Forearms on the floor, elbows under your shoulders.</string>
    <string name="plank_2">Legs straight, body in a line from head to heels.</string>
    <string name="plank_3">Brace your abs. Time only counts while your body is aligned.</string>
    <string name="pullup_1">Grip the bar a little wider than your shoulders.</string>
    <string name="pullup_2">Pull until your chin is over the bar.</string>
    <string name="pullup_3">Lower until your arms are fully straight.</string>
    <string name="burpee_1">From standing, squat and put your hands on the floor.</string>
    <string name="burpee_2">Kick your legs back into a plank (add a push-up if you like).</string>
    <string name="burpee_3">Bring your legs in, stand up and jump. That is 1 burpee.</string>
    <string name="walk_1">Tap Start and put the phone away.</string>
    <string name="walk_2">Walk or run as much as you want.</string>
    <string name="walk_3">Come back and tap Finish to get your time.</string>
    <string name="walk_status">Walking… steps are counted even with the screen off.</string>
    <string name="walk_no_sensor">This phone doesn\'t have a step sensor.</string>
    <string name="activity_permission_button">Allow step counting</string>
    <string name="activity_permission_denied">Step counting is blocked. Allow \"Physical activity\" in Settings > Apps > PushLife > Permissions.</string>
